{
  "slug": "bengo-toolkit",
  "name": "Bengo Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Japanese law firm plugin for Claude Code — court template filling, family tree generation (相続関係説明図),  legal document proofreading, lawsuit analysis, e-Gov law search, and deterministic legal calculators (traffic damages, child support, debt recalc, overtime, iryubun, property division, inheritance). Ships HMAC-chainedtamper-evident local audit logs (append-only JSONL with optional HMAC keying) recording which documents were processed, when, by which skill — without storing document contents. 日本の法律事務所向け Claude Code プラグイン — 裁判所書式入力・相続関係説明図・訴訟分析・法令検索・決定論的計算（交通事故・養育費・遺留分等）。",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**, **25 commands** and **3 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `child-support-calc` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"calculate child support\", \"養育費を計算\", \"婚姻費用を計算\", \"養育費月額\", \"婚姻費用分担額\", \"算定表で計算\",…), `debt-recalc` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"recalculate debt\", \"利息制限法で引き直し\", \"引き直し計算\", \"過払金\", \"過払い金\", \"サラ金\", \"貸金業者との取引履歴から引き直し\",…), `family-tree` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"analyze a koseki\", \"戸籍の分析\", \"家族関係\", \"相関図\", \"family tree\",…), `inheritance-calc` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"calculate inheritance shares\", \"法定相続分を計算\", \"相続分を出して\", \"相続割合\", \"誰がどれだけ相続する\", \"遺留分\",…), `iryubun-calc` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"calculate iryubun\", \"遺留分侵害額\", \"遺留分\", \"遺留分侵害額請求\", \"遺贈\", \"生前贈与の遺留分算入\", or…), `law-search` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"search a law\", \"法令検索\", \"条文を見せて\", \"法律を調べて\", \"○○法 第○条\",…), `lawsuit-analysis` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"analyze a lawsuit\", \"訴訟分析\", \"事件分析\", \"書面分析\", \"case analysis\",…), `overtime-calc` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"calculate overtime\", \"未払残業代計算\", \"残業代を計算\", \"労基法37条\", \"割増賃金\", \"深夜労働\", or…), and 7 more\n- **Commands** (25): `audit-config` (監査ログ設定を表示・変更する（記録先・HMAC・クラウド同期・ファイル名記録）), `case-info` (現在の案件フォルダの状態を表示する), `child-support-calc` (養育費・婚姻費用を令和元年改定算定方式で決定論的に計算), `debt-recalc` (貸金業者との取引履歴を利息制限法で引き直し、残債務・過払金を算出), `family-tree` (戸籍謄本PDFから家族関係を分析し相続関係説明図（自己完結HTML）を生成), `feedback` (不具合の報告・機能の要望をフォームから送る（GitHub アカウント不要）。/report-issue のエイリアス), `help` (タスクから bengo-toolkit の機能を探す対話型メニュー), `inheritance-calc` (家族関係図から法定相続分を自動計算), and 17 more\n- **MCP servers** (3): `xlsx-editor`, `docx-editor`, `agent-format`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install bengo-toolkit@claude-community` from `llamadrive/bengo-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
